-- The circulars' root (MMS-521): every circular that speaks to an item of
-- the shared vocabulary (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), registered once as an
-- instrument, and what it claims for a case. The root (l4/lib/root.l4)
-- imports it beside the takanon's and the agreements' roots and leaves
-- precedence — the later circular over the earlier among them —
-- to l4/lib/precedence.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT precedence
IMPORT terms
IMPORT `2008-09_tashsat_03`
IMPORT `2009-10_tasha_02`

§ `שורש החוזרים — מה החוזרים אומרים על כל פריט`

§§ `תוספת 2008`

-- Both circulars give the Treasury's method ("הוראות משרד האוצר", the
-- Deputy Wage Commissioner's letter of 7.12.2008): approved, for §29 of the
-- Budget Foundations Law (convention instruments.section-29-approval, as
-- תש"ע/2 itself reads it).
`circular תשס"ט/3` MEANS
    `instrument` WITH
        `module`        IS "2008-09_tashsat_03"
        `title`         IS "חוזר לבעלויות תשס\"ט/3, סעיף 2"
        `kind`          IS `a circular to the owning bodies`
        `is the takanon` IS FALSE
        `issued`        IS DATE_FROM_DMY 14 12 2008
        `practised for all state employees` IS FALSE
        `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS TRUE

`circular תש"ע/2` MEANS
    `instrument` WITH
        `module`        IS "2009-10_tasha_02"
        `title`         IS "חוזר לבעלויות תש\"ע/2, סעיף 2"
        `kind`          IS `a circular to the owning bodies`
        `is the takanon` IS FALSE
        `issued`        IS DATE_FROM_DMY 15 12 2009
        `practised for all state employees` IS FALSE
        `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS `the printed rate is approved by the Finance Minister`

GIVEN c IS A `2008 supplement case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the circulars' claims on the 2008 supplement` c IS
    catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `circular תשס"ט/3` (`the 2008 supplement according to circular תשס"ט/3` c),
                    `the claim of` `circular תש"ע/2` (`the 2008 supplement according to circular תש"ע/2` c))

-- Every instrument this root registers, for the root's report.
`the circulars' instruments` MEANS LIST `circular תשס"ט/3`, `circular תש"ע/2`
